BattleFrontier_Lounge5_Text_LadyClaimsSheUnderstandsPokemon::
	.string "真可爱！\n"
	.string "那位小姑娘说她能\l"
	.string "听懂宝可梦的话！$"

BattleFrontier_Lounge5_Text_GirlSayingSomethingProfound::
	.string "我总觉得那小姑娘在说\n"
	.string "什么深奥的话。$"

BattleFrontier_Lounge5_Text_GirlPlaysAtRedHouseALot::
	.string "我知道一件事！\p"
	.string "那小姑娘常在那栋红房子\n"
	.string "玩！$"

`
